    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i was looking at some old technical manuals today. stuff i spent twenty years mastering. it just hit me how much of that is just... gone. useless now. it feels like i've been replaced by a piece of software that doesn't even need to sleep or eat. it's hard to feel like i actually matter in a world that doesn't have a place for what i do anymore. feels like i'm just a ghost in the machine.",
